Comment: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:17.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k203}拿上你的報酬滾蛋
Comment: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k226}你在這裡不受歡迎
Comment: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:23.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k345}這裡沒人想看到你的臉 聽到你出聲
Comment: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k221}你是覺得自己一直在贏
Comment: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:27.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k211}但惡魔馬上就會來見你
Comment: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.51,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k384}你知道他為什麼想要你的靈魂 對吧
Comment: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:35.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k397}你那扭曲的欲望 把我們拖入了混亂
Comment: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.56,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k403}誤入歧途 分道揚鑣 一去不回
Comment: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:43.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k402}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Comment: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k337}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
Comment: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k271}我們建起的每座橋樑
Comment: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:52.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k256}你都占為己有又付之一炬
Comment: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:54.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k232}只餘灰燼
Comment: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.79,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k300}當天地萬物消失無蹤
Comment: 0,0:05:57.79,0:06:00.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k288}你才會想傾聆我們的聲音
Comment: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.17,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k151}低耳靜聽
Comment: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:06.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k392}尖聲求救
Comment: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:10.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k318}求救
Comment: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:14.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k330}求救
Comment: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:18.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k332}求救
Comment: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:17.67,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k40}Take {\k19}what {\k28}you {\k33}got {\k23}and {\k38}leave {\k22}now
Comment: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k39}You're {\k40}wearing {\k37}out {\k23}your {\k87}welcome
