Comment: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:27.68,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k29}But {\k24}soon {\k19}the {\k66}devil {\k26}will {\k45}come
Comment: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.51,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k54}You {\k20}konw {\k30}just {\k26}why {\k23}he {\k48}wants {\k40}you{\k4}, {\k46}don't {\k83}you{\k10}?
Comment: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:35.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k31}Your {\k81}crooked {\k99}desire {\k28}left {\k26}us {\k16}in {\k115}disarray
Comment: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:39.56,OPJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k99}Misguided{\k5}, {\k103}divided{\k5} {\k11}at {\k13}the {\k26}point {\k29}of {\k29}no {\k83}return
