Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.16,0:22:24.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:27.52,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:30.19,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:32.87,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:35.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}亮出利爪的那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:38.07,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}又想要用它去守護誰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:40.10,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}武器既可傷害也能保護
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.10,0:22:43.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}人生不正如這般的雙向交流嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:48.85,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}就算約定似隱似現 無人再能知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.85,0:22:53.35,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}也要一心遵守 度過烈火焦灼夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:56.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}無知狂笑著引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.12,0:22:58.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}任昔日萬象掌舵方向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.82,0:23:02.24,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}情緒染上呼出的濕氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}我無意在一無所知中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}讓它們被你掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.45,0:23:11.43,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}審視腦內想像後回歸自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:17.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}正解的逼迫是渴望將我吞食殆盡的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:22.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1075)\fad(300,300)}別再繼續阻擋我的道路了
